msgstr "2011,2013,2026"

#. (itstool) path: page/title
#: C/gnote-addin-replacetitle.page:25
msgid "Replace title"
msgstr "Byt ut tittel"

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/gnote-addin-replacetitle.page:26
msgid "When the <app>Replace title</app> plugin is installed, the command <gui>Replace title</gui> is present in the <gui>Note Actions</gui> menu."
msgstr ""
"Når tillegget <app>Byt ut tittel</app> er installert, finst kommandoen "
"<gui>Byt ut tittel</gui> i menyen <gui>Notathandlingar</gui>."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/gnote-addin-replacetitle.page:27
msgid "The <gui>Replace title</gui> command replaces a note's title with the current clipboard content. From any application copy text and press <gui>Replace title</gui> in the note to replace it's title with most recently copied text."
msgstr ""
"Kommandoen <gui>Byt ut tittel</gui> byter ut tittelen på eit notat med "
"innhaldet på utklippstavla. Kopier tekst frå ein app og trykk <gui>Byt ut "
"tittel</gui> i notatet for å byte ut tittelen med den sist kopierte teksten."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/gnote-addin-replacetitle.page:28
msgid "Alternatively, you can use the <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>R</key></keyseq> shortcut to trigger title replace."
msgstr ""
"Du kan òg bruke snarvegen <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>R</key></keyseq> for å"
" byte ut tittelen."

#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: C/gnote-addin-replacetitle.page:29
msgid "Also, you can change the behavior of this plugin in gsettings by changing the value of the '/org/gnome/gnote/replace-title/clipboard' key. There are two options: to use clipboard and to use primary selection (most recently selected text)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan òg endre korleis tillegget verkar i gsettings, ved å endre verdien "
"til nøkkelen '/org/gnome/gnote/replace-title/clipboard'. Det finst to val: å"
" bruke utklippstavla eller å bruke primærutvalet (den sist markerte "
"teksten)."

